  "translation": "Na king bilong Ashur i salim ⟨את⟩ Tartan, wantaim ⟨את⟩ Rav-Saris, wantaim ⟨את⟩ Ravshakeh, ol i kam long Lakis, go long king Hizkiyahu long Yerusalayim, wantaim bikpela grup bilong soldia; na ol i go antap na ol i kamap long Yerusalayim; na ol i go antap na ol i kamap, na ol i sanap long paip wara bilong ples wara i stap antap moa, we i stap long bigpela rot bilong gaden bilong man wasim klos.",
